@Practice.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5106

GET {{Practice.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Valid bookmark
POST http://localhost:5106/api/bookmarks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "MDN",
  "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org",
  "tag": "docs",
  "isFavorite": false
}

### A second valid bookmark
POST http://localhost:5106/api/bookmarks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Angular Docs",
    "url": "https://angular.dev",
    "tag": "docs",
    "isFavorite": false
}

### Invalid bookmark
POST http://localhost:5106/api/bookmarks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "url": "not a url",
  "tag": "docs",
  "isFavorite": false
}


### Get one bookmark. GUID's are generated on a per session basis and will need to be re-retrieved each time they're tested here.
GET http://localhost:5106/api/bookmarks/d8357e3e-0798-4c0a-b446-264edce0cbbd

### Get one that doesn't exist
GET http://localhost:5106/api/bookmarks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Delete a bookmark
DELETE http://localhost:5106/api/bookmarks/d8357e3e-0798-4c0a-b446-264edce0cbbd